{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48892","headline":"过南城县麻姑山 二 · 崔橹","name":"过南城县麻姑山 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗手难题画手慙，浅青浓碧垒东南。\n尘愁世界忙心在，霞伴神仙稳梦酣。\n雨涕自悲看雪鬓，星冠无计整云篸。\n家风负荷须名宦，可惜千峰绿似蓝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}